<title>RUSSIA: Russia plans 10 pct VAT on all Ukraine sugar.</title>
<headline>Russia plans 10 pct VAT on all Ukraine sugar.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1996-09-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Russia plans to levy a valued added tax of 10 percent on all raw and refined sugar imports from Ukraine beginning October 1, a state customs committee official said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>&quot;In line with a presidential decree dated August 18 and a government order dated September 3, the committee has decided to impose a value-added tax of 10 percent on all Ukrainian sugar imports, including raw sugar,&quot; Vladimir Yemelyanov, deputy head of the committee's press service, told Reuters.</p>
</text>
